/*visual: data architecture comparison showing monolith with single database and multiple modules vs microservices with separate databases per service, highlighting join limitations and data replication patterns*/
/*visual: deployment pipeline comparison showing single pipeline for monolith vs multiple coordinated pipelines for microservices, including versioning dependencies and rollback scenarios*/
