        children: ["\n", _jsxs(_components.p, {
          children: [_jsx(_components.strong, {
            children: "Treat service boundaries as first-class architectural decisions"
          }), ": If you adopt microservices, spend significant time identifying bounded contexts and service responsibilities. Poor boundaries create constant friction and coordination overhead. Good boundaries enable team autonomy and are worth the investment to get right."]
